message: "If you use or discuss this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "A Constructive N-Series Acceleration Law for Polygonal Approximation of π"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Baker
    given-names: Wayne
date-released: 2026-07-03
version: preprint-v1
repository-code: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/nseries-pi-acceleration"
url: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/nseries-pi-acceleration"
abstract: >-
  This paper gives a geometric interpretation of Richardson-type cancellation
  for polygonal approximations of pi. It derives the even-power error structure,
  proves two-scale and multi-scale cancellation laws, and records a pi-free
  algebraic chord-trisection verification.
keywords:
  - polygonal approximation
  - pi
  - Richardson extrapolation
  - N-series
  - chord trisection
  - constructive geometry
  - asymptotic acceleration
license: proprietary
